\textbf{SMART Criteria}: All goals should be \textbf{S}pecific, \textbf{M}easurable, \textbf{A}chievable, \textbf{R}elevant, and \textbf{T}ime-bound.

\subsection*{Short-Term Goals (1-3 months)}

